    description: Some("Safari Sam chases Bongo, a prankster ape, across three screens. Climb Waterfall Pass under a hail of coconuts, jump the chasm and shake off clinging monkeys; on Rhino Ridge, duck into mole holes to dodge charging rhinos; then hop across Lazy Lagoon on lily pads, hippos and fish to reach Bongo."),
